# HANG POWER CLEAN

Version 1.0

---

# Purpose

The Hang Power Clean is an explosive Olympic weightlifting derivative performed from the hang position to develop whole-body power, rapid force production and neuromuscular coordination.

Within CAS, it is considered one of the highest-value loaded power exercises for combat athletes.

---

# Philosophy

Explosive strength is only valuable if it can be produced rapidly.

The Hang Power Clean teaches athletes to generate force through triple extension while coordinating the entire kinetic chain.

CAS selects this exercise when maximizing explosive athletic performance is a primary objective.

